        "id": "s1",
        "title": {
          "en": "The duty word",
          "hi": "कर्तव्य का शब्द"
        },
        "image": {
          "id": "part-krtya-s1",
          "brief": "The Vetāla seated straight on a root with a solemn expression; the paper-fan spirit unfolding his last fold, which carries three lines of writing; Dādī and Śuka listening; firelight.",
          "alt": {
            "en": "A grey spirit sits straight and solemn while a paper-fan spirit opens its last fold",
            "hi": "सीधा और गम्भीर बैठा भूरा भूत, अन्तिम तह खोलता पंखे-सा भूत"
          },
          "text_in_image": [],
